WEBVTT

00:00:02.653 --> 00:00:06.113
… English, in the sense that

00:00:06.513 --> 00:00:10.010
we sat down together and translated

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.816
Sanskrit puja into English and

00:00:15.016 --> 00:00:20.187
tried to make it more 
understandable by [you people].

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:45.119
It’s the day of Mahalakshmi puja
they say, not only of Lakshmi Puja.

00:00:45.839 --> 00:00:49.575
There’s a difference between the two.

00:00:51.358 --> 00:00:53.787
Mahalakshmi

00:00:55.507 --> 00:01:01.775
is one of the powers of the three powers,

00:01:03.661 --> 00:01:06.010
main powers,

00:01:07.681 --> 00:01:12.272
of Adi Shakti.

00:01:15.645 --> 00:01:19.872
As you know:
Mahalakshmi, Mahasaraswati, Mahakali.

00:01:24.324 --> 00:01:31.652
Now these powers have powers

00:01:32.605 --> 00:01:39.206
at a material
level also, at a subtler level also.

00:01:42.386 --> 00:01:46.974
So Mahalakshmi power is achieved

00:01:49.013 --> 00:01:53.880
after Lakshmi power, as they say.

00:01:55.580 --> 00:02:01.441
So, the Lakshmi…
there are eight powers of Lakshmi.

00:02:02.618 --> 00:02:04.725
This Lakshmi was born,

00:02:04.925 --> 00:02:11.317
who came out of the sea,

00:02:11.939 --> 00:02:17.964
the great sea, which was churned
thousands and thousands of years back.

00:02:19.593 --> 00:02:23.977
And She came out of the sea
because She is the daughter of the sea.

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:27.914
That’s why She’s called as Neeraja.

00:02:28.115 --> 00:02:31.377
‘Neera’ means ‘water’
and ‘ja’ means ‘born out of’.

00:02:31.578 --> 00:02:36.080
This has happened thousands and 
thousand [of] years back that She was born.

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:39.493
So what is that?

00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:44.932
What is this Lakshmi symbolically, what is it
expressing?

00:02:48.224 --> 00:02:51.044
It is expressing the awareness.

00:02:51.698 --> 00:02:54.908
Lakshmi expresses awareness,

00:02:55.294 --> 00:02:58.946
and She came out of the sea, you know that.

00:02:59.672 --> 00:03:04.562
The awareness first started growing in the sea.

00:03:04.763 --> 00:03:10.324
The life started existing 
in the sea, to begin with,

00:03:10.524 --> 00:03:13.016
and then it grew out.

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:17.003
Without the life there is no awareness.

00:03:17.204 --> 00:03:22.882
First the life, because everything is
jada (inanimate matter), everything is dead.

00:03:24.249 --> 00:03:28.442
And when it becomes life
it means it has awareness.

00:03:28.868 --> 00:03:33.065
So the awareness started growing in the sea.

00:03:33.838 --> 00:03:37.082
This is the symbolic expression.

00:03:37.575 --> 00:03:42.582
In the gross level
you can understand this way.

00:03:43.309 --> 00:03:47.311
But actually in the subtle level,
it is the other way round.

00:03:47.512 --> 00:03:50.438
And because we see 
things from the gross level,

00:03:50.638 --> 00:03:52.799
we say that, that is symbolic.

00:03:52.999 --> 00:03:57.049
But actually from the other side 
if you say, “This is symbolic.”

00:03:57.956 --> 00:03:59.973
Do you understand this point?

00:04:01.333 --> 00:04:05.145
So for me it is symbolic to see how

00:04:07.245 --> 00:04:10.909
the life came into being in the sea

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:14.506
and that it became aware.

00:04:14.707 --> 00:04:19.292
For me it is symbolic. And for you
it is symbolic the other way round.

00:04:20.232 --> 00:04:24.164
I mean if I see something 
from this side, I see the,

00:04:25.051 --> 00:04:28.861
this way and while you see 
from that side you see this way.

00:04:29.315 --> 00:04:31.338
To understand this,

00:04:32.084 --> 00:04:35.162
if you want to paint something on a glass,

00:04:35.809 --> 00:04:38.745
how do you paint it on the glass?

00:04:40.329 --> 00:04:42.563
Have you any idea?

00:04:42.764 --> 00:04:45.732
You start painting first the outermost 
things that you have to paint.

00:04:45.933 --> 00:04:49.322
For example if you are painting the Goddess,

00:04:49.523 --> 00:04:51.917
first you will paint Her ornaments,

00:04:52.118 --> 00:04:55.529
then Her sari, then Her body.

00:04:57.408 --> 00:05:00.834
Like that it will be moving deeper from
this side,

00:05:01.034 --> 00:05:03.437
if you are painting it on the glass,

00:05:03.637 --> 00:05:06.173
because you have to see it from the other side.

00:05:07.899 --> 00:05:12.824
But supposing you have to paint it on a canvas,

00:05:13.878 --> 00:05:17.088
you’ll paint it the other way 
round. You first paint the body,

00:05:17.289 --> 00:05:19.753
then the sari and then the ornaments.

00:05:21.166 --> 00:05:24.523
So to one thing it is symbolic

00:05:25.757 --> 00:05:30.695
because they think
this goes from their angle.

00:05:30.896 --> 00:05:37.362
To the other person who is from the 
other angle this is absolutely symbolic.

00:05:38.302 --> 00:05:41.575
And it’s surprising that

00:05:42.714 --> 00:05:47.467
everything is so symbolic 
and so much just the same,

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:56.061
that whatever you may say, the subtle
remains subtle and the gross remains gross.

00:06:00.648 --> 00:06:07.560
The one who is at the subtle level sees the
gross as a symbolic expression of the subtle.

00:06:11.093 --> 00:06:15.602
Now She was born in the sea.

00:06:15.802 --> 00:06:18.145
She was called as Niraja.

00:06:18.345 --> 00:06:23.917
She was born in the sea. 
Now Nira, that means ‘water’.

00:06:24.117 --> 00:06:26.987
My name is, one of them is, Nira as you know.

00:06:27.187 --> 00:06:31.551
Out of Nirmala one name is Nira, Nima and Nira,

00:06:31.751 --> 00:06:35.929
like that I have got three names, 
four names I should say.

00:06:36.129 --> 00:06:38.398
The big one is Nirmala.

00:06:39.358 --> 00:06:42.769
So this Nira part means what?

00:06:43.786 --> 00:06:46.866
That She was born in the sea.

00:06:47.067 --> 00:06:54.181
That the name of Mary is also the same.

00:06:54.813 --> 00:06:59.986
Maryam or Mary, I don’t
know how you say in English.

00:07:00.186 --> 00:07:04.058
But Maryam this comes 
from ‘marine’. The word ‘marine’.

00:07:04.464 --> 00:07:07.794
‘Marine’ itself comes from the word Mary.

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:12.265
So, tell Me.

00:07:13.938 --> 00:07:16.344
Yogi: The coconut split.

00:07:17.391 --> 00:07:22.475
Shri Mataji: So this Mahalakshmi, Mary,

00:07:22.675 --> 00:07:25.879
is named and She is

00:07:26.305 --> 00:07:29.749
because She was born in the sea

00:07:30.296 --> 00:07:32.719
and that’s how Her name was Mary.

00:07:32.919 --> 00:07:38.610
Mariana they call Her, some people call
Her Mariana, sometime call Her Miriam.

00:07:38.811 --> 00:07:43.084
All these words are indicating
that She was born in the sea.

00:07:43.285 --> 00:07:48.394
So She is Mahalakshmi.
Now Mary is Mahalakshmi

00:07:51.587 --> 00:07:55.609
and Ganesha is the child.

00:07:56.935 --> 00:07:59.412
Now see how symbolically it works,

00:08:00.319 --> 00:08:02.842
that only in Diwali

00:08:03.189 --> 00:08:07.187
the Lakshmi and the Ganesha are
worshipped, only these two personalities.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.558
Can you understand that?

00:08:13.251 --> 00:08:19.546
The symbol of Mahalakshmi, for Me, is Mary.

00:08:19.746 --> 00:08:22.962
For you it is Mahalakshmi is the symbol.

00:08:23.497 --> 00:08:29.922
And the symbol of Ganesha outside is Christ.

00:08:32.769 --> 00:08:35.482
He is symbolising Ganesha.

00:08:36.328 --> 00:08:40.620
So, both of them are worshipped only on a
Diwali day.

00:08:41.546 --> 00:08:44.610
So actually this is the Christmas.

00:08:46.057 --> 00:08:49.396
This is the real Christmas that was before also,

00:08:49.596 --> 00:08:52.565
and this was the time baby Christ was born,

00:08:54.738 --> 00:08:56.743
not the 25th of December.

00:08:56.943 --> 00:09:01.074
Though it’s a misunderstanding, 
doesn’t matter, keep it up.

00:09:01.275 --> 00:09:04.410
Doesn’t matter, whenever He’s born.

00:09:04.868 --> 00:09:10.457
Because there used
to be a very big festival,

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:15.555
and after the festival He was born.

00:09:16.708 --> 00:09:19.993
It’s called as Valanan. I don’t
know what you call in modern times.

00:09:20.193 --> 00:09:22.661
That time it was called like
that.

00:09:22.976 --> 00:09:28.840
And then this child was born and that
was the time Christmas was celebrated.

00:09:29.729 --> 00:09:35.706
It was just tallying with that, but somehow
it shifted. I don’t know how, how it shifted.

00:09:35.907 --> 00:09:40.513
And there might be somewhere you will
find out that the real Christmas was shifted.

00:09:41.042 --> 00:09:42.816
Gavin Brown: Yes it was. That's known.

00:09:43.016 --> 00:09:45.371
Shri Mataji: All right.

00:09:46.906 --> 00:09:50.863
And symbolically in this lifetime also,

00:09:51.416 --> 00:09:56.096
in the Kali Yuga also, same
thing happens that Mahalakshmi

00:09:57.195 --> 00:10:00.874
and Ganesha were born, and
that’s why they are worshipped.

00:10:01.074 --> 00:10:04.410
Now you ask anyone, why Ganesha
and Mahalakshmi are worshipped,

00:10:04.611 --> 00:10:07.874
after all, on a Diwali day?

00:10:08.334 --> 00:10:11.378
And it was the darkest night.

00:10:14.701 --> 00:10:20.486
It was the darkest night, and 
that night a star was there.

00:10:21.385 --> 00:10:27.961
And because it was such a dark night
that star was very much noticed by everyone.

00:10:30.917 --> 00:10:36.849
It was a cold night, very
cold night, and a dark night.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:46.539
So the symbol of Diwali is 
very great for Sahaj Yogis.

00:10:52.490 --> 00:11:00.137
First of all you have to know there are
four days that are celebrated in Diwali.

00:11:01.204 --> 00:11:06.985
But there is one more day 
added to it in Maharashtra.

00:11:07.672 --> 00:11:12.505
The first day of Diwali is called as

00:11:13.538 --> 00:11:16.362
Dhanatrayodashi:

00:11:16.828 --> 00:11:20.080
is the thirteenth day of the moon.

00:11:21.432 --> 00:11:27.453
Because that day is the first day when Lakshmi,

00:11:27.673 --> 00:11:31.357
the first one, was born on the thirteenth day.

00:11:32.004 --> 00:11:37.664
That means She was born as a
Gruhalakshmi, as a housewife.

00:11:39.297 --> 00:11:44.771
Now there are eight Lakshmis,
which she will read it out.

00:11:44.971 --> 00:11:48.449
And I will tell you later on what is the
meaning of them. One of them is Gruhalakshmi.

00:11:48.649 --> 00:11:54.087
So the first is the form of a Gruhalakshmi.

00:11:56.222 --> 00:12:00.485
She is born as a Gruhalakshmi to begin with.

00:12:01.538 --> 00:12:09.329
That means the awareness of 
human beings also, started really

00:12:10.808 --> 00:12:14.868
getting into evolutionary process

00:12:15.068 --> 00:12:18.273
when they started their family life.

00:12:18.474 --> 00:12:26.425
When they were vagabonds moving about,
then the awareness was just like animals.

00:12:27.652 --> 00:12:31.251
Though they had become human
beings, but they were like animals.

00:12:32.470 --> 00:12:35.855
Then when they established their families,

00:12:37.001 --> 00:12:41.293
then the Gruhalakshmi
started working and that’s how

00:12:41.494 --> 00:12:45.798
the first advent of Gruhalakshmi was felt.

00:12:46.771 --> 00:12:50.436
So, She’s the first Lakshmi who was born,

00:12:51.503 --> 00:12:58.611
and that’s why on that thirteenth day is the
day of the Gruhalakshmi, of the housewife.

00:12:59.484 --> 00:13:05.385
And so one has to go in the
market and buy some utensils

00:13:05.585 --> 00:13:09.522
or something that she uses
for cooking in the house.

00:13:10.128 --> 00:13:14.067
In India on the thirteenth day everyone goes

00:13:14.267 --> 00:13:20.800
and buys a pot or, we can say, what you call,

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:24.823
a cooking utensil or something.

00:13:25.632 --> 00:13:30.109
Or they may buy a sari

00:13:30.309 --> 00:13:34.073
or something or gold or 
something for the Gruhalakshmi.

00:13:35.421 --> 00:13:39.011
That is the day of the household.

00:13:42.108 --> 00:13:49.541
So to reach the Lakshmi one has to 
understand that motherhood is very important.

00:13:51.081 --> 00:13:56.402
The motherhood, as a Gruhalakshmi is important.

00:13:58.983 --> 00:14:02.775
Then the second day is even more important

00:14:05.142 --> 00:14:08.414
because Narakasura was killed.

00:14:09.547 --> 00:14:12.385
Horrible Narakasura, as you know him.

00:14:13.192 --> 00:14:17.724
But actually that day many
rakshasas are killed in many…

00:14:17.924 --> 00:14:21.427
That’s a day fixed for killing rakshasas.

00:14:22.887 --> 00:14:26.813
And then they are put in the hell.

00:14:27.014 --> 00:14:31.463
On the fourteenth
day they are put in the hell.

00:14:32.443 --> 00:14:36.809
So that’s called as Naraka Chaturdashi.
That is the day when the hell is opened out.

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:40.687
That day Sahaja Yogis are supposed
to sleep in the night while everybody

00:14:40.887 --> 00:14:44.663
does all kinds of tantrikavidya
and all that on the fourteenth day.

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:51.624
Then the fifteenth is that darkest night.

00:14:52.637 --> 00:14:57.430
That’s the darkest night when there is no moon.

00:14:59.049 --> 00:15:06.753
Absolutely that’s the day when they 
celebrate Deepawali, Diwali day.

00:15:06.953 --> 00:15:09.929
But symbolically, in India also,

00:15:10.169 --> 00:15:17.130
Shri Rama returned to his place

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:20.926
on that day and was crowned on that day.

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:26.881
So the significance of Diwali

00:15:27.187 --> 00:15:31.880
is expressed in this manner:

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:37.055
that this is the day when Narakasura,
and all of them are killed,

00:15:37.256 --> 00:15:40.259
they have all gone to Narak,
they have gone to the hell,

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:45.991
and the people now are saved from 
them and they are celebrating the joy.

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:51.560
And that is the time when Christ was born.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.393
That’s why lights are to be put in the night,

00:15:54.594 --> 00:15:59.111
because He was born at 
twelve o’clock in the night.

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:06.360
So, the next day to that,
is the day [which] is celebrated in India

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:10.678
only in Maharashtra. I don’t know [if]
people celebrate otherwise. I don’t know.

00:16:10.878 --> 00:16:12.996
Do you celebrate the next day?

00:16:13.196 --> 00:16:14.874
Yogini: The next day?

00:16:15.075 --> 00:16:17.510
That’s the first day of the moon.

00:16:18.756 --> 00:16:22.949
That is the forefathers of
your Mother, Shalivahanas,

00:16:23.149 --> 00:16:26.440
they started a calendar, from that date.

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:32.258
And so on the first [day],

00:16:33.324 --> 00:16:36.920
that means the first day of the moon,

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:42.120
the new year is celebrated here.

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:48.680
Now see symbolically, Christ is born
and a new year is celebrated the next day.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:52.120
As soon as He is born the new year should start.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:59.519
So next year it starts, the new year.

00:17:02.365 --> 00:17:09.234
That is a new year in many parts of our
country where Shalivahana ruled there.

00:17:09.435 --> 00:17:17.400
The Shalivahana was my forefather,
I should say, they were just a dynasty.

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:21.720
And this dynasty ruled in India since very long.

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:29.322
Even in the old puranas it is written
that they helped Krishna in their war.

00:17:33.153 --> 00:17:39.891
You know all the story about 
Shalivahana, quite a lot.

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:46.840
And so the new year starts.
So for us that is the new year.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:51.240
For Sahaj Yogis that is the new year
and you have to accept it.

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:53.640
And your Mother is of that dynasty.

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:58.724
I mean no force on you but 
if you like you can have it.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:02.920
Then the second
day is also very important:

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:07.980
is the second day [of] the moon.

00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:15.000
That is [when] the moon came out of the sea.

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:19.880
According to this mythology,
the Lakshmi came out of the sea

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:26.958
and with Her this moon came out,
which was only a two day old moon,

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:30.790
the new moon but a two day old moon.

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:35.047
And this was regarded as the brother of Lakshmi,

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:41.554
because they were born at 
the same time, from the sea.

00:18:42.173 --> 00:18:48.013
So He is the brother of Lakshmi. It’s
all symbolic. It’s very, very symbolic.

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:53.666
Now you see the left side is,

00:18:56.996 --> 00:19:01.440
left side, you know is that of,

00:19:05.377 --> 00:19:08.341
belongs to Mahakali,

00:19:09.907 --> 00:19:15.421
and a brother had to,

00:19:17.274 --> 00:19:21.141
be on this side, on the left side.

00:19:24.087 --> 00:19:26.600
But actually you will be amazed

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:30.803
that He is the brother of Lakshmi.

00:19:31.443 --> 00:19:35.720
He is not a brother of Mahakali.

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:40.038
But because He’s the brother of Lakshmi

00:19:40.432 --> 00:19:45.857
he is accepted as a brother of all the
goddesses: one brother for all of them.

00:19:46.251 --> 00:19:50.802
So He is the only brother, who is this moon.

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:56.040
So He is your uncle,
He is your maternal uncle.

00:19:56.240 --> 00:20:01.434
It’s very interesting. Because we have
a special right on our maternal uncle,

00:20:01.634 --> 00:20:05.837
we can always ask for His help.

00:20:06.677 --> 00:20:12.283
And it’s a big story about this churning

00:20:12.484 --> 00:20:18.537
that took place that Shiva
saw all the poison also coming out.

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:22.989
So He drank the poison because He
was the only one who could drink the poison.

00:20:23.189 --> 00:20:28.761
And He got so heated up in His head, in His neck

00:20:29.121 --> 00:20:31.838
that He wanted something to cool Him.

00:20:32.458 --> 00:20:36.102
So He took to this,

00:20:40.706 --> 00:20:43.795
moon and put it on His head.

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:48.920
So, the crowning [of Shiva] is the moon.

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:55.320
Now if you see, on Monday 
is the day of Sahasrara.

00:20:59.706 --> 00:21:03.129
Monday is the day of the Moon.

00:21:03.708 --> 00:21:08.167
Monday is the day of Sahasrara
because Sadashiva has put it on His head.

00:21:08.647 --> 00:21:13.725
And that’s what people tease Him that,
“Your brother-in-law is sitting on your head.”

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:22.014
It’s very [interesting]. It’s very
symbolic for you — not for me,

00:21:22.214 --> 00:21:25.960
but for you — that the 
brother-in-law is sitting on the head.

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:28.721
This brother-in-law is very important,

00:21:29.587 --> 00:21:35.700
and if brother-in-law is in any way angry
then even Sadashiva has to think twice.

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:40.132
An all very special 
relationship, which is very sweet,

00:21:42.492 --> 00:21:45.183
and which is very expressive.

00:21:46.331 --> 00:21:51.349
And if you want to understand it,
that your brother-in-law

00:21:52.426 --> 00:21:54.213
— is a naughty little thing

00:21:54.774 --> 00:21:58.384
— is the brother of the wife. If you have to
keep your wife pleased, that is the power,

00:21:58.818 --> 00:22:02.234
you have to keep
the brother-in-law quite happy.

00:22:02.624 --> 00:22:06.359
So He said it’s better to keep him on 
His head. He said to [UNCLEAR love them]

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:10.440
If there’s a naughty child,
what do you do to a naughty child?

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:13.120
You put him up somewhere
there so he doesn’t move.

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:17.983
Always you take a child 
outside, you put him out there.

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:23.141
And He is very dear to Sadashiva,

00:22:23.355 --> 00:22:26.912
who really loves Him in a special way.

00:22:27.920 --> 00:22:34.559
And that day is the day
when all the sisters

00:22:39.179 --> 00:22:41.494
worship their brothers

00:22:42.468 --> 00:22:45.263
— it’s very important it is.

00:22:46.507 --> 00:22:54.199
[On] Raksha Bandhan day they give
a symbolic expression to their desire

00:22:54.400 --> 00:22:57.637
that their brother should be good,

00:22:57.837 --> 00:23:05.080
but on this day they worship their
brothers, they actually worship them.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:09.903
They are invited at home, 
they are made to sit on the

00:23:10.436 --> 00:23:14.200
special type of a seat,

00:23:14.400 --> 00:23:18.898
then also aarti is done to them.

00:23:19.098 --> 00:23:24.511
Sometimes if they are very small, younger
brothers, then they are even given bath nicely.

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:29.042
If they are older brothers
also they’ll cover all their body,

00:23:29.242 --> 00:23:32.144
but water will be poured on them as a symbol

00:23:32.344 --> 00:23:35.240
and they are given new dresses to wear.

00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:38.600
And very special food is cooked that day.

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:42.587
And then they are served special
food ahead of their husbands.

00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:47.080
Always husband is served first, but
that day a brother gets the food first.

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:49.640
And then the brother-in-law is teased a lot,

00:23:49.840 --> 00:23:56.200
and the younger brother-in-law
teases his sister’s husband.

00:23:56.400 --> 00:24:01.720
And it’s a very nice function.
It’s called as Bhau-Beej.

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:08.280
And that day the brother gives
some things to the sister as a present.

00:24:08.480 --> 00:24:14.628
He will give even if you don’t have
anything, you can give anything, whatever it is.

00:24:16.435 --> 00:24:22.894
But you give something as a 
symbol of your love to your sister.

00:24:23.573 --> 00:24:30.168
And this day, today, is that day.
It’s such a nice day to do puja.

00:24:31.063 --> 00:24:35.621
This is the day when we all adjust together.

00:24:36.080 --> 00:24:38.677
But for a Gruhalakshmi,

00:24:39.870 --> 00:24:42.360
the brother is very important.

00:24:43.200 --> 00:24:47.086
And the brotherhood and sisterhood

00:24:47.286 --> 00:24:51.991
is the base of our Sahaj Yoga collectivity.

00:24:52.464 --> 00:24:56.795
If you understand that brotherhood and sisterhood

00:24:57.582 --> 00:25:01.400
is love which is very pure.

00:25:01.906 --> 00:25:07.252
There is no expectation.

00:25:08.000 --> 00:25:13.658
It’s just love.
It’s giving love and taking love.

00:25:14.187 --> 00:25:21.240
And absolute purity within
us should exist between our relationships

00:25:21.440 --> 00:25:26.097
when we call them as 
Sahaj Yogi brothers and sisters.

00:25:26.298 --> 00:25:30.969
And as there is understanding,
complete understanding,

00:25:31.170 --> 00:25:36.200
between the brother and sister in a family,

00:25:36.400 --> 00:25:43.320
one has to know we are all part and 
parcel of a family, born of the same Mother.

00:25:43.520 --> 00:25:48.040
Nobody has to shoot off or nobody 
has to become something great,

00:25:48.240 --> 00:25:52.760
nobody has to correct others,
nobody has to say that,

00:25:52.960 --> 00:25:57.080
“I’m something unique.”
All of you have to work it out together

00:25:57.280 --> 00:26:02.533
and find out a solution working out
together in complete friendship and unison.

00:26:02.734 --> 00:26:07.399
Anyone who cuts off himself and goes out

00:26:07.600 --> 00:26:12.177
or becomes anything else, goes out of
circulation and is useless for Sahaj Yoga.

00:26:12.697 --> 00:26:15.720
Such a person is completely useless.

00:26:15.920 --> 00:26:22.093
The one who tries to get out of the family.

00:26:22.366 --> 00:26:27.800
All of you have to be supporting
each other, helping to each other,

00:26:28.000 --> 00:26:31.240
not shouting at each other
or getting angry with each other;

00:26:31.440 --> 00:26:34.493
trusting each other, not finding faults;

00:26:35.313 --> 00:26:38.360
treating each other with respect and love.

00:26:38.560 --> 00:26:41.720
This is the most important thing
the Sahaj Yogis don’t understand —

00:26:41.920 --> 00:26:45.240
that you are saints and you 
have to respect each other.

00:26:45.440 --> 00:26:48.360
For example, you cannot 
doubt each other, you cannot.

00:26:48.560 --> 00:26:51.677
That’s not allowed, it’s prohibited.

00:26:54.156 --> 00:26:57.002
You are not to doubt each other.

00:26:58.800 --> 00:27:01.494
Here where, I would say that:

00:27:01.694 --> 00:27:07.425
if somebody slaps you on 
one cheek, turn the other.

00:27:09.172 --> 00:27:11.730
That will work out here.

00:27:12.283 --> 00:27:15.073
In this Sahaj Yoga one has to do it.

00:27:15.760 --> 00:27:19.160
Not to criticise anyone,
not to put down anyone.

00:27:19.360 --> 00:27:23.000
You are all Saints,
why don’t you recognise it?

00:27:23.200 --> 00:27:25.320
How can you insult a saint?

00:27:25.520 --> 00:27:30.875
You are men of God, do you realise that?

00:27:31.235 --> 00:27:35.675
How can you put down anyone and say, 
“They are not good,” and, “They are good”?

00:27:35.875 --> 00:27:39.924
If you start doing that, somebody else will take
advantage of you

00:27:40.218 --> 00:27:44.596
and will really push you down and you will be in
very great trouble.

00:27:46.856 --> 00:27:51.070
Never get into such funny ideas,
that you are better than the others,

00:27:52.486 --> 00:27:54.306
that you can do better than the others.

00:27:54.506 --> 00:27:57.720
The one who starts doing the
better is doing the greatest harm.

00:27:57.920 --> 00:28:01.546
There is no competition in Sahaj Yoga.

00:28:03.600 --> 00:28:07.240
Give up this idea of competition.
You are brothers and sisters.

00:28:07.440 --> 00:28:09.960
You have to support each other, help each other.

00:28:10.160 --> 00:28:12.680
Anybody is going down,
try to work out on them.

00:28:12.880 --> 00:28:15.960
If you find somebody is going
down too much beat him with shoes.

00:28:16.160 --> 00:28:18.589
But anybody who thinks he is very great,

00:28:18.790 --> 00:28:22.401
he has this special quality or that quality:

00:28:22.601 --> 00:28:27.139
supposing somebody thinks he is very neat,
he should hang himself by the nearest tree.

00:28:27.339 --> 00:28:33.118
That’s what I sometimes feel. Because on
this point there are so many quarrels going on.

00:28:34.175 --> 00:28:37.009
But somebody who thinks
he has a right to be untidy

00:28:37.209 --> 00:28:39.160
also should hang himself by the nearest tree.

00:28:39.360 --> 00:28:43.000
And should know that, “I’m making
an inconvenience of myself to others.”

00:28:43.200 --> 00:28:46.680
You must respect.
If there is no mutual respect,

00:28:46.880 --> 00:28:50.622
this brother and sister relationship is not there.

00:28:52.868 --> 00:28:57.228
It’s a very sweet relationship
which you have not enjoyed unfortunately.

00:28:57.429 --> 00:28:59.771
But in India we have.

00:28:59.971 --> 00:29:03.415
Our brothers will give up their lives for us.

00:29:04.022 --> 00:29:07.240
And we will give our lives for our brothers.

00:29:07.440 --> 00:29:12.317
And our brothers have so much 
faith in us that if we tell them that,

00:29:12.517 --> 00:29:17.089
“You should not do this.” they 
know that this we are doing only

00:29:17.289 --> 00:29:21.593
just to help him out,

00:29:21.893 --> 00:29:25.391
not to show off our great importance

00:29:25.591 --> 00:29:30.302
or giving a big sermon, 
but it is just because we love.

00:29:31.263 --> 00:29:35.525
The love is so established and 
if that love is not established,

00:29:35.726 --> 00:29:38.830
what are you showing off about?

00:29:39.680 --> 00:29:45.800
Today is, in a way, a very great year,
in the brothers and sisters relationship.

00:29:46.000 --> 00:29:49.720
How do you express your brothers
and sisters relationship?

00:29:49.920 --> 00:29:53.697
I do not like to hear complaints,

00:29:53.898 --> 00:29:57.640
but I see that it is full of ego.

00:29:57.840 --> 00:30:00.419
The reason is,

00:30:01.039 --> 00:30:05.251
people are behaving in such a 
manner that I cannot understand

00:30:05.452 --> 00:30:08.593
that you are saints. What has happened to you?

00:30:10.506 --> 00:30:12.680
How can you be individualistic?

00:30:12.880 --> 00:30:15.814
I’ll give you a simple example:

00:30:17.880 --> 00:30:22.568
we have got in our house some sort of plants,

00:30:22.769 --> 00:30:26.151
which could only grow inside the
house, but when it was summertime,

00:30:26.351 --> 00:30:28.841
we put them outside and they were growing well.

00:30:29.041 --> 00:30:32.905
But when the winter came 
in suddenly one night they all

00:30:33.105 --> 00:30:37.328
became absolutely dead you can call it.

00:30:38.002 --> 00:30:42.507
So, the servant got upset he said, “What
to do now?” I said, “You bring them [inside].”

00:30:42.707 --> 00:30:46.011
Now he said, “They won’t
grow.” I said, “They will.” I said,

00:30:46.211 --> 00:30:50.562
“You get four [or] five of
them, put them together in one.”

00:30:51.713 --> 00:30:54.372
And they started growing well.

00:30:57.202 --> 00:31:03.314
Because whatever is missing in one
person, you support from the another person.

00:31:05.600 --> 00:31:10.200
And this support is so natural
and spontaneous which flows.

00:31:10.400 --> 00:31:13.144
If you try to correct others

00:31:14.017 --> 00:31:17.609
then you are draining out your energy
and the energy of another person.

00:31:17.809 --> 00:31:21.092
Just try to support that person.

00:31:21.978 --> 00:31:27.650
That’s how it works out. And that’s how [CUT]

00:31:28.273 --> 00:31:31.840
have to make them into saplings,

00:31:32.160 --> 00:31:36.220
we never put them separately
we put them together, in a small block.

00:31:36.421 --> 00:31:39.917
If you put them separately
they will never come up.

00:31:40.480 --> 00:31:45.000
Then they are kept in that 
condition together, till they grow.

00:31:45.200 --> 00:31:49.033
When they are grown, 
then only they are taken from

00:31:49.900 --> 00:31:55.179
that collective group and put separately.

00:31:56.480 --> 00:32:00.840
Have you not seen this happening?
And this is what is collectivity.

00:32:01.040 --> 00:32:05.240
At the delicate point
when Sahaj Yoga is coming up,

00:32:05.440 --> 00:32:08.480
we have to be much more closer together.

00:32:09.188 --> 00:32:14.158
Later on when you are very powerful it’s all
right because you will have greater rapport.

00:32:14.359 --> 00:32:20.638
But it’s such a vicious circle that at this
time when you are weak you are also falling off.

00:32:24.160 --> 00:32:27.012
And this collectivity

00:32:27.898 --> 00:32:30.581
is all-embracing.

00:32:31.356 --> 00:32:35.640
Of course these are due to your ego,
superego, whatever problems.

00:32:35.840 --> 00:32:39.858
But only together you are going to be.

00:32:41.271 --> 00:32:45.148
But I have seen, when you are
mesmerised, you fall in love with each other,

00:32:45.349 --> 00:32:49.000
absolutely: when you are mesmerised.

00:32:49.200 --> 00:32:54.200
But when there is freedom,
you cannot enjoy your collectivity.

00:32:54.400 --> 00:32:59.320
In freedom people find it very difficult:
then somebody behaves like an ascetic,

00:32:59.520 --> 00:33:04.776
some behaves like a madcap, somebody
behaves like a hot-tempered fellow,

00:33:04.977 --> 00:33:10.200
another behaves like a 
city consul. I don’t know.

00:33:10.400 --> 00:33:14.259
When it is freedom you do not grow

00:33:15.132 --> 00:33:17.815
in a healthy way together.

00:33:20.800 --> 00:33:25.937
You must know there must be something within
you which is keeping you out from collectivity.

00:33:27.359 --> 00:33:31.062
At this stage the best thing is to
surrender and beat yourself with shoes.

00:33:31.440 --> 00:33:34.920
Any such ideas come into 
your head you just do that way.

00:33:35.120 --> 00:33:37.560
That’s the way it will work out.

00:33:37.760 --> 00:33:41.966
Today is the day you have 
to promise, today, here.

00:33:42.167 --> 00:33:46.003
Where is Cooly?
I can’t see him. Is he there?

00:33:46.204 --> 00:33:49.687
Yogini: He wasn’t allowed to come, Mother.
Shri Mataji: Hmm?

00:33:49.888 --> 00:33:51.756
Yogi: I think you said he wasn’t 
allowed to come, Mother.

00:33:51.957 --> 00:33:54.840
Shri Mataji: He’s not come?
Yogini: He wasn’t allowed to come, Mother.

00:33:55.040 --> 00:33:59.303
Shri Mataji: He was not allowed?
Yogi: I think you told him that he wasn’t allowed.

00:34:01.106 --> 00:34:02.908
Shri Mataji: All right.

00:34:05.664 --> 00:34:10.241
I did say.
I’m sorry. I did, I had to.

00:34:11.680 --> 00:34:15.320
Certain things had to be done.

00:34:16.926 --> 00:34:19.330
I am sorry.

00:34:21.400 --> 00:34:24.062
But you must know you are people

00:34:25.302 --> 00:34:28.212
who are chosen specially.

00:34:28.759 --> 00:34:33.238
What prophecies are made for you if you read
that ‘Milton’ you will know —

00:34:33.438 --> 00:34:37.442
the English people. What prophecies.

00:34:38.400 --> 00:34:42.535
“The Men of God will be there

00:34:42.735 --> 00:34:47.085
and they will have their own heroes and
they will not follow these Romans and Greeks

00:34:47.285 --> 00:34:52.850
and their horrible heroes. They’ll have
their innocent heroes, and all those things.”

00:34:53.810 --> 00:34:57.963
And here I find that

00:34:58.789 --> 00:35:05.224
there’s a kind of a passion for falling down.

00:35:07.120 --> 00:35:12.120
Keep together. Keep together.
Love each other. Understand them.

00:35:12.320 --> 00:35:16.660
Love not of mesmerism, but of freedom.

00:35:16.861 --> 00:35:19.824
In freedom you must love each other.

00:35:20.324 --> 00:35:22.988
I never take away your freedom, that’s one thing,

00:35:23.188 --> 00:35:26.680
whether you fall or rise. 
First thing is for your freedom.

00:35:26.880 --> 00:35:30.601
That is the thing on which you are going to move.

00:35:31.440 --> 00:35:35.219
So today is the day
where you all have to promise

00:35:35.600 --> 00:35:43.334
and pray that, this brotherhood
and sisterhood will be established.

00:35:45.646 --> 00:35:52.404
Ask for it in this soil of 
England, this is the Jerusalem.

00:35:52.904 --> 00:35:55.286
Ask for that,

00:35:55.600 --> 00:36:00.200
that this will be established
on the soil of Jerusalem.

00:36:00.400 --> 00:36:03.762
That’s the most important thing.

00:36:06.371 --> 00:36:10.201
And you will be surprised 
that once this is established,

00:36:10.401 --> 00:36:13.401
Lakshmi is established.

00:36:19.440 --> 00:36:23.240
Now Mahalakshmi has eight aspects.

00:36:23.440 --> 00:36:28.440
Now read about these eight aspects.
How many there are, let us see.

00:36:33.419 --> 00:36:35.919
First follow.

00:36:38.110 --> 00:36:42.555
Yogini: Om Twameva Sakshat 
Shri Adya Lakshmi Namoh Namah.

00:36:42.755 --> 00:36:46.771
Shri Mataji: Adya Lakshmi. Adya Lakshmi
means Mahalakshmi. Adya Lakshmi.

00:36:47.258 --> 00:36:51.776
Adi, Adya. Adya Lakshmi: that’s the first one.

00:36:53.040 --> 00:36:55.946
You say now, you repeat it.

00:36:56.147 --> 00:37:02.299
Yogis: Om twameva Sakshat,
Shri Adya Lakshmi Sakshat,

00:37:02.500 --> 00:37:08.959
Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat, Shri Bhagawati Sakshat,

00:37:09.160 --> 00:37:16.447
Shri Mataji, Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha.

00:37:17.012 --> 00:37:19.237
Shri Mataji: Now, second one.

00:37:22.774 --> 00:37:26.720
Yogini: Om Twameva Sakshat Shri Vidya
Lakshmi Namoh Namah.

00:37:26.920 --> 00:37:31.883
Shri Mataji: Vidya – vidya is the
art of Sahaj Yoga, which you know.

00:37:32.083 --> 00:37:34.760
That is vidya. The rest is all avidya.

00:37:34.960 --> 00:37:40.280
How to raise the Kundalini;
how to awaken all the deities;

00:37:40.480 --> 00:37:43.800
how to cleanse yourself;
how to cleanse others.

00:37:44.000 --> 00:37:50.301
All the knowledge; all the science about
that is called as vidya: the Lakshmi of that.

00:37:50.948 --> 00:37:54.280
Lakshmi is the grace, is the grace.

00:37:54.480 --> 00:37:59.044
The awareness that is gracious.

00:37:59.244 --> 00:38:01.640
The awareness that is gracious.

00:38:01.840 --> 00:38:08.520
So that Lakshmi should be with you,
not only to know the vidya,

00:38:08.720 --> 00:38:10.760
you know that, but to have grace about it.

00:38:10.960 --> 00:38:14.217
The way people do things, for example:

00:38:14.418 --> 00:38:17.288
some people will just go on.

00:38:18.240 --> 00:38:23.059
All that kind of a nonsense you do.
Sometimes the way we go on working

00:38:23.259 --> 00:38:27.160
and I’m giving a lecture
and people are just working out.

00:38:27.360 --> 00:38:31.880
All that is most disgraceful
and disgracious (ungracious).

00:38:32.080 --> 00:38:35.914
So not to do these methods

00:38:36.380 --> 00:38:41.138
of making the thing look so disgracious.

00:38:41.600 --> 00:38:44.760
I mean you need not 
be serious people at all,

00:38:44.960 --> 00:38:48.026
because Sahaj Yoga is not a serious thing.

00:38:48.226 --> 00:38:50.360
It is a play.

00:38:50.560 --> 00:38:52.684
It is a play of grace.

00:38:52.884 --> 00:38:57.640
You have to be gracious; you are not 
to be disgraceful, that’s very important.

00:38:57.840 --> 00:39:03.480
If you are disgraceful
then your vidya is useless.

00:39:03.680 --> 00:39:06.680
I have seen many people all the 
time doing like this, doing like that;

00:39:06.880 --> 00:39:11.116
they think that it’s their left hand job, you see,

00:39:11.316 --> 00:39:13.560
and they have become now masters of this job.

00:39:13.760 --> 00:39:18.080
There’s no grace about it.
One has to see how to do it graciously.

00:39:19.236 --> 00:39:22.586
Do you see your Mother, how 
She moves Her hands and feet.

00:39:22.793 --> 00:39:26.397
Not one day, one time,

00:39:26.885 --> 00:39:31.362
even in one action you will find Me
doing something nonsensical like that

00:39:31.563 --> 00:39:34.913
except when I copy you.

00:39:40.960 --> 00:39:44.520
So this is what it is,
is the Vidya Lakshmi.

00:39:44.720 --> 00:39:48.118
Lakshmi is the grace to do everything.

00:39:48.319 --> 00:39:50.603
Come, second one, third.

00:39:51.382 --> 00:39:52.806
Yogini: Om twameva Sakshat, Shri-

00:39:53.006 --> 00:39:55.265
Shri Mataji: ...and now you 
could say it. “Om twameva…”

00:39:55.466 --> 00:40:01.933
Yogis: Om twameva sakshat, 
Shri Vidya Lakshmi sakshat,

00:40:02.133 --> 00:40:09.138
Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat, Shri Bhagawati Sakshat,

00:40:09.339 --> 00:40:16.520
Shri Mataji, Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha.

00:40:16.720 --> 00:40:20.704
Shri Mataji: For Left Swadishthana
you know this is the Mantra.

00:40:23.496 --> 00:40:25.496
Third One.

00:40:25.697 --> 00:40:31.548
Yogini: Om twameva sakshat Shri 
Saubhagnya Lakshmi namoh namaha.

00:40:32.394 --> 00:40:38.240
Shri Mataji: Sau-bha-gya,
Saubhagnya means ‘good fortune’.

00:40:39.910 --> 00:40:45.055
The Lakshmi that gives you 
good fortune in every way.

00:40:45.520 --> 00:40:48.947
Like She gives you good fortune in money,

00:40:50.215 --> 00:40:55.119
in your living, in your food, in every way.

00:40:55.739 --> 00:40:58.962
Any good fortune is given through God.

00:40:59.163 --> 00:41:05.720
It’s only God who gives good fortune.
If you get money say in the racecourse,

00:41:05.920 --> 00:41:10.154
that’s bad fortune because 
that will be lost next day

00:41:10.355 --> 00:41:12.904
or you will go to the pub to be free.

00:41:13.310 --> 00:41:18.977
But if you get the real one, then you

00:41:20.529 --> 00:41:26.999
create something out of it which is
blissful and great: is Saubhagnya Lakshmi.

00:41:27.199 --> 00:41:30.326
Now, say it. Saubhagnya Lakshmi.

00:41:30.589 --> 00:41:38.029
Yogis: Om twameva sakshat, 
Shri Saubaghya Lakshmi Sakshat,

00:41:38.229 --> 00:41:41.979
Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat,

00:41:42.180 --> 00:41:47.705
Shri Bhagawati Sakshat, Shri Mataji,

00:41:47.905 --> 00:41:53.832
Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha.

00:41:54.033 --> 00:41:56.033
Shri Mataji: Amruta.

00:41:56.841 --> 00:42:01.284
Yogini: Om Twameva Sakshat
Shri Amrut Lakshmi Namah.

00:42:01.484 --> 00:42:06.410
Shri Mataji: Amruta, Amruta. Amruta
means the thing that does not die.

00:42:09.013 --> 00:42:11.462
In this world

00:42:12.550 --> 00:42:17.434
the Lakshmi exists as your wealth.

00:42:18.280 --> 00:42:23.508
Now the wealth that does 
not die, which is that wealth?

00:42:24.025 --> 00:42:27.244
Yogi: Is spirit.
Shri Mataji: Is the Spirit.

00:42:29.379 --> 00:42:34.798
So the grace of the Spirit
is the Amruta Lakshmi.

00:42:35.486 --> 00:42:40.931
Grace of the Spirit is the Amruta Lakshmi.
The rest of the things all will die out.

00:42:41.406 --> 00:42:46.016
And whatever is done through 
the Spirit, to please the Spirit,

00:42:46.873 --> 00:42:49.434
is the Amruta Lakshmi,

00:42:49.980 --> 00:42:52.337
for example:

00:42:54.058 --> 00:42:56.887
loving others.

00:42:59.326 --> 00:43:02.847
Loving others has a different meaning in the

00:43:03.427 --> 00:43:08.705
symbolic way as you people
understand it. Loving means giving;

00:43:08.906 --> 00:43:12.985
doing without any expectation.

00:43:13.185 --> 00:43:17.534
Just doing and enjoying it.

00:43:20.680 --> 00:43:24.068
The greatest is giving vibrations.

00:43:26.841 --> 00:43:29.974
That is Amruta. Vibrations do not die.

00:43:31.187 --> 00:43:36.443
That’s the Lakshmi of the Amruta.

00:43:37.976 --> 00:43:42.434
Yogis: Om Twameva sakshat,

00:43:42.634 --> 00:43:46.657
Shri Amruta Lakshmi Sakshat,

00:43:46.857 --> 00:43:50.821
Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat,

00:43:51.022 --> 00:43:56.334
Shri Bhagawati Sakshat, Shri Mataji,

00:43:56.534 --> 00:44:02.069
Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha.

00:44:05.698 --> 00:44:09.862
Yogini: Om Twameva Sakshat Shri Kaam Lakshmi…

00:44:10.062 --> 00:44:13.475
Shri Mataji: No, Gruhalakshmi.
You know that, Gruhalakshmi.

00:44:14.445 --> 00:44:21.759
Yogis: Om twameva Sakshat, Shri Gruhalakshmi
Sakshat,

00:44:21.959 --> 00:44:25.695
Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat,

00:44:25.895 --> 00:44:31.636
Shri Bhagawati Sakshat, Shri Mataji,

00:44:31.836 --> 00:44:37.315
Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha”.

00:44:39.878 --> 00:44:44.568
Yogini: Om Twameva Sakshat
Shri Satya Lakshmi Namah.

00:44:44.768 --> 00:44:47.840
Shri Mataji: Sa-tya: [as] I told awareness.

00:44:48.040 --> 00:44:52.080
She is the one who 
has given you awareness.

00:44:52.280 --> 00:44:55.693
Awareness is Lakshmi’s character.

00:44:56.266 --> 00:44:59.610
Satya means the truth.

00:45:00.860 --> 00:45:06.340
As you rise in your awareness,
you know the truth.

00:45:06.680 --> 00:45:08.806
Now what is the truth?

00:45:09.486 --> 00:45:11.742
What is the truth?

00:45:13.602 --> 00:45:16.213
What are we aware of?

00:45:19.480 --> 00:45:24.822
You are aware that you are the instrument of God

00:45:25.495 --> 00:45:29.840
and that He is working through you.

00:45:30.040 --> 00:45:35.719
You are aware of that because it’s flowing
on your central nervous system.

00:45:37.146 --> 00:45:42.406
This is the truth of which you have to be aware.

00:45:46.006 --> 00:45:49.248
What is the other truth?

00:45:49.448 --> 00:45:53.317
Is who are you?

00:45:54.572 --> 00:45:57.679
That you are the Spirit.

00:45:57.880 --> 00:46:02.165
And the third truth is, who am I?

00:46:04.813 --> 00:46:09.373
And the fourth truth is who is God?

00:46:10.040 --> 00:46:12.569
What is your destiny?

00:46:13.753 --> 00:46:19.598
If they become your awareness,
then you have got Satya Lakshmi.

00:46:20.077 --> 00:46:22.077
Say now.

00:46:22.278 --> 00:46:25.750
Yogis: Om Twameva Sakshat,

00:46:25.950 --> 00:46:30.021
Shri Satya Lakshmi Sakshat,

00:46:30.354 --> 00:46:34.017
Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat,

00:46:34.218 --> 00:46:39.997
Shri Bhagawati Sakshat, Shri Mataji,

00:46:40.197 --> 00:46:45.422
Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha.

00:46:48.622 --> 00:46:52.472
Yogini: Om Twameva Sakshat
Shri Bhogya Lakshmi Namah.

00:46:52.673 --> 00:46:54.579
Shri Mataji: Mm?
Yogini: Bhogya Lakshmi.

00:46:54.780 --> 00:46:56.766
Shri Mataji: Bhogya Lakshmi.

00:46:58.002 --> 00:47:02.531
Bho-gya: ‘Bhoga’ means 
the one by which you enjoy,

00:47:04.520 --> 00:47:06.770
by which you enjoy.

00:47:07.243 --> 00:47:11.963
I mean it’s like the whole 
ocean of joy is around you

00:47:12.163 --> 00:47:15.866
and you are like a bird who cannot drink it.

00:47:17.279 --> 00:47:21.038
Only through the grace of Bhogya Lakshmi,

00:47:21.278 --> 00:47:26.009
Bhogya Lakshmi, you can enjoy that.

00:47:27.363 --> 00:47:32.183
So, the Spirit, though it is manifesting,
you are not enjoying your Spirit

00:47:32.383 --> 00:47:34.229
– even that.

00:47:35.452 --> 00:47:37.555
Anything that you see —

00:47:38.694 --> 00:47:42.059
say you see a flower —
you should be able to enjoy.

00:47:42.259 --> 00:47:45.075
You cannot enjoy because there is thought.

00:47:47.206 --> 00:47:51.662
Anything you do [if] there is thought,
you cannot enjoy.

00:47:55.308 --> 00:48:02.480
When the Spirit is flowing
you get complete enjoyment.

00:48:02.680 --> 00:48:07.250
Actually I should say,
I am the enjoyer of it.

00:48:14.748 --> 00:48:18.396
Yogis: Om twameva Sakshat,

00:48:18.596 --> 00:48:22.867
Shri Bhogya Lakshmi Sakshat,

00:48:23.067 --> 00:48:26.868
Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat,

00:48:27.069 --> 00:48:32.877
Shri Bhagawati Sakshat, Shri Mataji,

00:48:33.077 --> 00:48:38.479
Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha.

00:48:42.609 --> 00:48:47.025
Yogini: Om Twameva Sakshat
Shri Yoga Lakshmi Namah.

00:48:47.226 --> 00:48:49.194
Shri Mataji: Yoga Lakshmi.

00:48:51.640 --> 00:48:55.932
The Lakshmi’s power which gives you Yoga.

00:48:59.867 --> 00:49:02.707
Lakshmi supports

00:49:03.793 --> 00:49:07.078
your power of yoga

00:49:08.270 --> 00:49:11.140
by giving you awareness.

00:49:11.946 --> 00:49:19.129
The power by which you take to 
yoga is all combined as Yoga Lakshmi.

00:49:21.293 --> 00:49:25.696
Like your affluence: you are not satisfied

00:49:25.896 --> 00:49:28.532
and you want to have Yoga.

00:49:28.732 --> 00:49:31.402
The dissatisfaction you get

00:49:31.768 --> 00:49:36.741
till you have got yoga is 
coming from the Yoga Lakshmi.

00:49:38.541 --> 00:49:43.914
So Yoga Lakshmi is the power which

00:49:45.941 --> 00:49:50.268
gives you or takes you to your grace,

00:49:50.468 --> 00:49:54.558
by which you go to yoga:
that’s Yoga Lakshmi.

00:49:54.758 --> 00:49:58.529
Means the kind of a satisfaction that you seek

00:50:02.760 --> 00:50:09.272
is manifested in you through
this power of Yoga Lakshmi.

00:50:10.519 --> 00:50:14.239
And then once you have achieved 
your yoga, you get the grace.

00:50:14.440 --> 00:50:16.680
Lakshmi is the grace.

00:50:17.287 --> 00:50:22.118
So you get the grace of a saint.

00:50:23.606 --> 00:50:26.824
You should have the grace of a saint.

00:50:27.250 --> 00:50:30.361
You should look like a saint. You are a saint.

00:50:33.024 --> 00:50:36.573
I think better write it on your mirrors,

00:50:36.774 --> 00:50:39.036
“We are saints.

00:50:39.896 --> 00:50:41.920
We are men of God.

00:50:42.120 --> 00:50:44.675
We have to behave like saints.

00:50:45.548 --> 00:50:49.200
We are saints.” You are, no doubt.

00:50:49.400 --> 00:50:51.615
You are men of God, no doubt,

00:50:51.815 --> 00:50:55.198
but you have to turn your faces this way.

00:50:55.733 --> 00:50:59.121
So, this is the Yoga Lakshmi.

00:50:59.322 --> 00:51:01.572
For example a person

00:51:01.880 --> 00:51:05.882
who has got Yoga Lakshmi
doesn’t quarrel like a madcap.

00:51:07.653 --> 00:51:12.203
If he quarrels or dominates someone

00:51:13.329 --> 00:51:17.341
in a foolish way then he’s still lacking
that Lakshmi point.

00:51:19.461 --> 00:51:22.947
There’s a grace about it, 
the whole way of talking.

00:51:23.147 --> 00:51:26.250
How you talk to a saint?

00:51:29.286 --> 00:51:31.055
All right.

00:51:31.761 --> 00:51:39.330
Yogis: Om twameva Sakshat, Shri Yoga
Lakshmi Sakshat,

00:51:39.530 --> 00:51:47.049
Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat, Shri Bhagawati Sakshat,

00:51:47.250 --> 00:51:49.573
Shri Mataji,

00:51:49.773 --> 00:51:55.546
Shri Nirmala Devi Namoh Namaha.

00:52:00.942 --> 00:52:03.653
Shri Mataji: So these are the eight-fold

00:52:06.007 --> 00:52:08.064
paths

00:52:10.111 --> 00:52:15.012
by which one has to grace oneself.

00:52:15.480 --> 00:52:19.370
This is the attire of Sahaj Yogis.

00:52:21.151 --> 00:52:23.941
And today you have asked for it.

00:52:24.540 --> 00:52:29.986
May God give you that power.

00:52:57.212 --> 00:53:01.459
One more thing I have to say just
before we start doing the thing [is]

00:53:01.659 --> 00:53:06.409
that around the Lakshmi you know is the Void.

00:53:07.086 --> 00:53:10.688
And though the Lakshmi

00:53:12.100 --> 00:53:17.528
in a situation where there is negativity,

00:53:17.728 --> 00:53:20.331
She runs away, She is frightened.

00:53:20.531 --> 00:53:23.334
She is a frightened Deity.

00:53:23.534 --> 00:53:26.704
She is very sensitive.

00:53:26.904 --> 00:53:32.455
She doesn’t like any negativity. As soon 
as the negativity comes in She runs away.

00:53:33.986 --> 00:53:41.392
In the same way those people, those great
saints who were born on the Void, have said

00:53:41.592 --> 00:53:47.358
that, “Those people who try to frighten Lakshmi

00:53:47.558 --> 00:53:54.800
are the people who are
irreligious,” in the sense they drink.

00:53:55.000 --> 00:53:57.260
Those people who drink,

00:53:58.213 --> 00:54:01.638
in the third generation lose 
their Lakshmi completely.

00:54:03.560 --> 00:54:05.509
You can see the results now:

00:54:05.709 --> 00:54:11.508
those who used to take one peg (30 ml of alcohol),
now are sitting in the pub the whole night.

00:54:12.348 --> 00:54:18.455
And that’s what it is that, once these
things enter into your family or household,

00:54:18.655 --> 00:54:21.391
they start corroding your Lakshmi.

00:54:21.592 --> 00:54:28.632
That’s why we have to understand that
Lakshmi is very, very sensitive to this point.

00:54:29.452 --> 00:54:34.071
And Lakshmi is extremely sensitive to fanaticism,

00:54:34.638 --> 00:54:39.135
extremely sensitive to fanaticism.

00:54:39.579 --> 00:54:42.513
Any kind of fanatic ideas you have got,

00:54:43.066 --> 00:54:46.563
She will run away. She can’t stand fanaticism.

00:54:46.764 --> 00:54:51.155
As soon as fanaticism will
settle down into any country,

00:54:51.355 --> 00:54:55.378
it will start becoming poorer and poorer.

00:54:55.579 --> 00:55:01.725
Any kind of fanaticism
about religion is to be avoided.

00:55:02.351 --> 00:55:08.272
Now so many young people who are
aware of fanaticism because, thank God,

00:55:08.472 --> 00:55:13.716
there are some horrible fanatics
which have proved that fanaticism is bad,

00:55:14.510 --> 00:55:17.014
and they are now coming round it.

00:55:17.439 --> 00:55:22.954
But when fanaticism works out, the expulsion of

00:55:24.462 --> 00:55:29.292
all the powers of Lakshmi from within,

00:55:29.493 --> 00:55:37.200
that’s the sure and certain sign that you
really invite cancer, really invite cancer.

00:55:37.400 --> 00:55:41.305
Also alcohol does, but 
this is the triggering point.

00:55:41.505 --> 00:55:48.560
If an alcoholic is as well as a 
fanatic, it will trigger much faster.

00:55:48.760 --> 00:55:53.680
Fanaticism is to be to be avoided
like leprosy for Sahaja Yogis.

00:55:53.880 --> 00:55:59.195
But not only that, we have to stand up
in a revolt against all kinds of fanaticism.

00:55:59.396 --> 00:56:05.628
Just this is the revolution
against all fanaticism of life.

00:56:08.329 --> 00:56:13.263
That’s very important for 
the establishment of Shri Lakshmi.

00:56:13.464 --> 00:56:19.466
Any religion, any fanaticism
that collides with another religion

00:56:20.290 --> 00:56:25.282
or in any way belittles it — because all
religions are just the same of one God

00:56:25.482 --> 00:56:29.025
— belittles another religion or insults anyone

00:56:30.605 --> 00:56:36.240
is absolutely against Lakshmi’s Principle.

00:56:36.440 --> 00:56:42.366
So we go, after all this, when we rise
above this, we go to Mahalakshmi principle.

00:56:42.566 --> 00:56:46.657
Now the awareness that 
was seeking up to Lakshmi

00:56:46.857 --> 00:56:50.774
— means you achieve money,
achieve position for achieving grace,

00:56:50.974 --> 00:56:55.412
once you have achieved the grace 
of this, you want to achieve God.

00:56:55.612 --> 00:56:59.323
And this new awakening within you

00:56:59.523 --> 00:57:04.293
that you have to achieve God 
now is the power of Mahalakshmi.

00:57:04.494 --> 00:57:11.520
By the power of Mahalakshmi only, you
achieve your saintliness, your Realisation.

00:57:11.720 --> 00:57:16.240
That’s why She came on this 
earth as the Mother of Jesus Christ.

00:57:16.440 --> 00:57:20.290
That was Mahalakshmi,
not Lakshmi but Mahalakshmi.

00:57:22.114 --> 00:57:24.754
May God bless you.